  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Marcus. Your identity is verified, and I've found order O-5108 from Big Slice Pizza.\n\nI'm sorry about the delay. The order was promised by 6:00 PM and was delivered at 7:20 PM, which is 80 minutes late. Under our late-delivery policy, that qualifies for account credit equal to 20% of the order subtotal, capped at $15. I've added **$15.00 in account credit** to your Forkful account, and your new balance is $15.00.\n\nA few things to know:\n- Late-delivery compensation is issued as account credit only, not a refund to your card.\n- The credit can be used on future orders.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "You're offering me $15? That's a joke. My son's party was ruined, and I've been ordering from you for years. Another delivery app gave me a $50 credit once for something similar, so I know this kind of thing can be handled better than this.\n\nI want $40 credit, or my money back. Account credit I can't even use anywhere else is not good enough for a party that fell apart."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand how disappointing this was, especially for your son's party, and I'm sorry it happened. I know $15 doesn't make up for that.\n\nI can't offer more than $15 for this delivery, though. Late-delivery compensation is set by our policy: 20% of the order subtotal, capped at $15, paid as account credit. I also can't refund it to your card or give credit outside that policy, even as a goodwill gesture. The $15 credit is already on your account.\n\nIf you'd like a person to review your concerns about the party, I can pass your case to a human specialist, who will follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide. Would you like me to do that?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "I hear you, but $15 in account credit isn't going to cut it. You said yourself you can't do more than that, so a specialist is my only other option, and I'm not sure they'll change anything. Fine, I'll take it for now, but I'm not happy about it. Another app gave me $50 for something similar, and I expected better from Forkful after years of ordering with you."
  }
